  - id: node_cashier_prompt_bag
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: 
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: "Thu ng\xE2n"
    speakerId: npc_cashier
    textJa: "\u888B\u306F\u8981\u308A\u307E\u3059\u304B\uFF1F"
    textReading: "\u3075\u304F\u308D\u306F\u3044\u308A\u307E\u3059\u304B\uFF1F"
    textEn: "Qu\xFD kh\xE1ch c\xF3 c\u1EA7n t\xFAi kh\xF4ng?"
    textRomaji: Fukuro wa irimasu ka?
    animationCue: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - textJa: "\u306F\u3044\u3001\u304A\u9858\u3044\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
      textEn: "V\xE2ng, xin vui l\xF2ng."
      nextNodeId: node_bag_yes
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: Vocabulary
        value: 10
        reason: "Hi\u1EC3u t\u1EEB t\xFAi (fukuro)"
      - category: Grammar
        value: 10
        reason: "D\xF9ng m\u1EABu ~onegaishimasu"
      grammarTags: []
      vocabularyTags: []
    - textJa: "\u3044\u3044\u3048\u3001\u5927\u4E08\u592B\u3067\u3059\u3002"
      textEn: "Kh\xF4ng, t\xF4i \u1ED5n r\u1ED3i. Kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n t\xFAi."
      nextNodeId: node_bag_no
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: Vocabulary
        value: 10
        reason: "Hi\u1EC3u t\u1EEB t\xFAi (fukuro)"
      - category: Grammar
        value: 10
        reason: "D\xF9ng m\u1EABu ~daijoubu desu"
      grammarTags: []
      vocabularyTags: []
    - textJa: "\u888B\u3092\u8981\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002"
      textEn: "T\xF4i c\u1EA7n t\xFAi. (Sai tr\u1EE3 t\u1EEB)"
      nextNodeId: node_bag_wrong_grammar
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: Grammar
        value: -10
        reason: "Sai tr\u1EE3 t\u1EEB: \u8981\u308B th\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111i v\u1EDBi
          \u304C ho\u1EB7c \u306F"
      - category: ResponseAccuracy
        value: -5
        reason: "Ph\u1EA3n x\u1EA1 ch\u01B0a ch\xEDnh x\xE1c"
      grammarTags: []
      vocabularyTags: []
    targetItemId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: node_bag_wrong_grammar
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: node_bag_yes
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: "Thu ng\xE2n"
    speakerId: npc_cashier
    textJa: "\u3059\u307F\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3001\u888B\u306F\u5FC5\u8981\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F\u304B\u3057\u3053\u307E\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
    textReading: "\u3059\u307F\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3001\u3075\u304F\u308D\u306F\u3072\u3064\u3088\u3046\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F\u304B\u3057\u3053\u307E\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002"
    textEn: "\xDD b\u1EA1n l\xE0 b\u1EA1n c\u1EA7n t\xFAi ph\u1EA3i kh\xF4ng? \u1EDE
      qu\u1EA7y thanh to\xE1n, c\xE1ch n\xF3i t\u1EF1 nhi\xEAn l\xE0 \u201C\u306F\u3044\u3001\u304A\u9858\u3044\u3057\u307E\u3059\u201D
      ho\u1EB7c \u201C\u3044\u3044\u3048\u3001\u5927\u4E08\u592B\u3067\u3059\u201D."
    textRomaji: Sumimasen, fukuro wa hitsuyou desu ka? Kashikomarimashita.
    animationCue: point
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    targetItemId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: node_bag_yes
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: node_pay_choice
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: "Thu ng\xE2n"
    speakerId: npc_cashier
    textJa: "\u304B\u3057\u3053\u307E\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u888B\u4EE33\u5186\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\u304A\u4F1A\u8A08\u306F500\u5186\u3067\u3059\u3002"
    textReading: "\u304B\u3057\u3053\u307E\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u3075\u304F\u308D\u3060\u3044\u3055\u3093\u3048\u3093\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002\u304A\u304B\u3044\u3051\u3044\u306F\u3054\u3072\u3083\u304F\u3048\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002"
    textEn: "T\xF4i hi\u1EC3u r\u1ED3i. Ti\u1EC1n t\xFAi l\xE0 3 y\xEAn. T\u1ED5ng
      c\u1ED9ng l\xE0 500 y\xEAn \u1EA1."
    textRomaji: Kashikomarimashita. Fukurodai san-en ni narimasu. Okaikei wa gohyaku-en
      desu.
    animationCue: bow
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    targetItemId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: node_bag_no
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: node_pay_choice
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: "Thu ng\xE2n"
    speakerId: npc_cashier
    textJa: "\u304B\u3057\u3053\u307E\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u304A\u4F1A\u8A08\u306F497\u5186\u3067\u3059\u3002"
    textReading: "\u304B\u3057\u3053\u307E\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u304A\u304B\u3044\u3051\u3044\u306F\u3088\u3093\u3072\u3083\u304F\u304D\u3085\u3046\u3058\u3085\u3046\u306A\u306A\u3048\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002"
    textEn: "T\xF4i hi\u1EC3u r\u1ED3i. T\u1ED5ng c\u1ED9ng l\xE0 497 y\xEAn \u1EA1."
    textRomaji: Kashikomarimashita. Okaikei wa yonhyaku kyujuunana-en desu.
    animationCue: bow
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    targetItemId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: node_pay_choice
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: 
    objectiveIdToComplete: 
    speakerName: "H\u1EC7 th\u1ED1ng"
    speakerId: system
    textJa: "\u652F\u6255\u65B9\u6CD5\u3092\u9078\u629E\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
    textReading: "\u3057\u306F\u3089\u3044\u307B\u3046\u307B\u3046\u3092\u305B\u3093\u305F\u304F\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
    textEn: "H\xE3y ch\u1ECDn ph\u01B0\u01A1ng th\u1EE9c thanh to\xE1n."
    textRomaji: Shiharai houhou wo sentaku shite kudasai.
    animationCue: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - textJa: "\u3053\u308C\u3067\u304A\u9858\u3044\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
      textEn: "Thanh to\xE1n b\u1EB1ng c\xE1i n\xE0y \u1EA1."
      nextNodeId: node_transaction_done
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: Grammar
        value: 15
        reason: "D\xF9ng m\u1EABu thanh to\xE1n \u201Ckore de\u201D"
      grammarTags: []
      vocabularyTags: []
    - textJa: "\u30AB\u30FC\u30C9\u3067\u6255\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002"
      textEn: "Thanh to\xE1n b\u1EB1ng th\u1EBB."
      nextNodeId: node_transaction_done
      scoreModifiers:
      - category: Vocabulary
        value: 10
        reason: "D\xF9ng t\u1EEB th\u1EBB (kaado)"
      grammarTags: []
      vocabularyTags: []
    targetItemId: 
    targetAreaId: 
  - id: node_transaction_done
    nodeType: 0
    nextNodeId: node_complete
    objectiveIdToComplete: obj_pay
    speakerName: "Thu ng\xE2n"
    speakerId: npc_cashier
    textJa: "\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3054\u3056\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\u307E\u305F\u304A\u8D8A\u3057\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u307E\u305B\u3002"
    textReading: "\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3054\u3056\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002\u307E\u305F\u304A\u3053\u3057\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u307E\u305B\u3002"
    textEn: "Xin c\u1EA3m \u01A1n qu\xFD kh\xE1ch. H\u1EB9n g\u1EB7p l\u1EA1i qu\xFD
      kh\xE1ch l\u1EA7n sau."
    textRomaji: Arigatou gozaimasu. Mata okoshi kudasaimase.
    animationCue: bow
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
